{"id":"efe8e2f202483a88","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-manifold-coordinate-data.md","title":"Manifold Coordinate Differential Data","display":"df-manifold-coordinate-data — Manifold Coordinate Differential Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-manifold-coordinate-data","aliases":["58-df-manifold-coordinate-data"],"display":"df-manifold-coordinate-data — Manifold Coordinate Differential Data","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-manifold-coordinate-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-manifold-coordinate-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-manifold-coordinate-data — Manifold Coordinate Differential Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f9e7fe466acfa12\" href=\"?note=3f9e7fe466acfa12\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-chart.md\">../batch01/58-df-chart.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S&#39;=\\langle N,\\sigma,\\mathcal B,m\\rangle\">\\(S&#39;=\\langle N,\\sigma,\\mathcal B,m\\rangle\\)</span> 为光滑流形记录。切空间、光滑函数及向量场采用 <code>58-df-smooth-tensor-data</code> 的指定结构记号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>坐标卡 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\">\\(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}\\)</span> 要求与整个给定图册相容。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi^{-1}\">\\(\\phi^{-1}\\)</span> 仅在已经约束为双射的坐标卡上取逆函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_i=\\{\\langle x,F(x)(i)\\rangle:x\\in O\\}\">\\(F_i=\\{\\langle x,F(x)(i)\\rangle:x\\in O\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(i,j)\">\\(J(i,j)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\">\\(J(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\)</span>。欧氏空间的加法、范数和零向量按有限函数坐标逐点定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}_n(A)=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists y\\in A\\;\\|x-y\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{cl}_n(A)=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists y\\in A\\;\\|x-y\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chart}\">\\(\\mathrm{Chart}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f9e7fe466acfa12\" href=\"?note=3f9e7fe466acfa12\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-chart.md\">../batch01/58-df-chart.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CriticalPointData}\">\\(\\mathrm{CriticalPointData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JacobianData}\">\\(\\mathrm{JacobianData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentCoordinates}\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentCoordinates}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(c,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land\n\\exists U,W,\\phi\\;\\bigl[c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Chart}_S(U,W,\\phi,M,\\tau,n)\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A\\cup\\{c\\},n)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(c,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land\n\\exists U,W,\\phi\\;\\bigl[c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Chart}_S(U,W,\\phi,M,\\tau,n)\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A\\cup\\{c\\},n)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TangentCoordinates}_{58}(x,v,c,S,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(c,S)\\land\\exists U,W,\\phi\\;\\bigl[c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\n\\land p\\in U\\land v\\in T(S,p)\\land x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\exists h\\in C(S)\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(p\\in O\\subseteq U\\land\\forall q\\in O\\;h(q)=\\phi(q)(i)\\land x(i)=v(h)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TangentCoordinates}_{58}(x,v,c,S,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothChart}_{58}(c,S)\\land\\exists U,W,\\phi\\;\\bigl[c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\n\\land p\\in U\\land v\\in T(S,p)\\land x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\exists h\\in C(S)\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(p\\in O\\subseteq U\\land\\forall q\\in O\\;h(q)=\\phi(q)(i)\\land x(i)=v(h)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{JacobianData}_{58}(J,F,O,n,m,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(F,O,n,m)\\land x\\in O\\land J\\in\\mathbb R^{m\\times n}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D\\in(\\mathbb R^O)^{m\\times n}\\;\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\forall j&lt;n\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(D(i,j),F_i,O,n,j)\\land J(i,j)=D(i,j)(x)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{JacobianData}_{58}(J,F,O,n,m,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(F,O,n,m)\\land x\\in O\\land J\\in\\mathbb R^{m\\times n}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D\\in(\\mathbb R^O)^{m\\times n}\\;\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\forall j&lt;n\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(D(i,j),F_i,O,n,j)\\land J(i,j)=D(i,j)(x)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CriticalPointData}_{58}(p,f,S,S&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S&#39;)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n,N,\\sigma,\\mathcal B,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\exists O\\in\\tau\\;\\exists J,F,a\\;\\bigl[\np\\in O\\subseteq U\\land f[O]\\subseteq V\\\\\n&amp;\\land F=\\{\\langle\\phi(q),\\psi(f(q))\\rangle:q\\in O\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{JacobianData}_{58}(J,F,\\phi[O],n,m,\\phi(p))\\\\\n&amp;\\land a\\in\\mathbb R^m\\land\\exists i&lt;m\\;a(i)\\ne0\n\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;\\sum_{i&lt;m}a(i)J(i,j)=0\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CriticalPointData}_{58}(p,f,S,S&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S&#39;)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n,N,\\sigma,\\mathcal B,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\exists O\\in\\tau\\;\\exists J,F,a\\;\\bigl[\np\\in O\\subseteq U\\land f[O]\\subseteq V\\\\\n&amp;\\land F=\\{\\langle\\phi(q),\\psi(f(q))\\rangle:q\\in O\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{JacobianData}_{58}(J,F,\\phi[O],n,m,\\phi(p))\\\\\n&amp;\\land a\\in\\mathbb R^m\\land\\exists i&lt;m\\;a(i)\\ne0\n\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;\\sum_{i&lt;m}a(i)J(i,j)=0\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在局部坐标中以偏导数函数图定义微分矩阵；秩不满用非零左零向量表达。切导子的坐标分量通过局部坐标函数的全局光滑延拓定义，不要求坐标函数本来就在全局函数代数中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-chart.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f9e7fe466acfa12","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-chart.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f9e7fe466acfa12","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Chart}$ 取 [[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-7","tar